OL,3,GNEWSAHousing wants first refusal on
OL,4,Aformer States sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's Committee for Housing wants
OL,7,Ffirst refusal on three States-owned
OL,8,Fsites that could be freed up if plans
OL,9,Ffor a new children's services hub are
OL,10,Fapproved by the States.
OL,12,FAn amendment to a policy letter on a
OL,13,Fproposed #22m hub would give Housing
OL,14,Fthe first opportunity to assess land at
OL,15,FLukis House, Swissville and Garden Hill
OL,16,Ffor affordable and mixed-tenure
OL,17,Fhousing.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
