OL,3,GNEWSAHousing wants first refusal on
OL,4,Aformer States sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sites would become available if
OL,7,Fchildren's services teams, currently
OL,8,Fspread across five locations, moved
OL,9,Finto a refurbished Raymond Falla House
OL,10,Funder Health and Social Care's plans.
OL,12,FDeputy Steve Williams, who lodged the
OL,13,Famendment, said the move could create
OL,14,Fbetween 70 and 150 homes across the
OL,15,Fthree sites.
